Import the C function ps_jump_mark taking an integer, returning an integer, from the header "plainspeak_runtime.h".
Import the C function ps_jump taking an integer and an integer, returning void, from the header "plainspeak_runtime.h".
Declare code as integer.
Set code to Call ps_jump_mark with 0 done.
If code is equal to 0 then:
    Say "first pass".
    Call ps_jump with 0, 42 done.
    Say "not reached".
Else:
    Say "recovered".
    Say code.
End if.
